      "en": "Jacob lifted up his eyes, and looked, and, behold, Esau was coming, and with him four hundred men. He divided the children between Leah, Rachel, and the two servants.",
      "ko": "야곱이 눈을 들어 보니 에서가 사백인을 거느리고 오는지라 그 자식들을 나누어 레아와 라헬과 두 여종에게 맡기고",
      "source_text_hash": "e136e4b9528242167cdeeb0fae85ccf931dd04254c42fbfdf97079264ef679d8",
      "translation_text_hash": "a262e81cf470e706503a4e857b8125ec0e5ffa9a2f9b93ad319538e1e1808ab4",
