      "en": "He himself passed over in front of them, and bowed himself to the ground seven times, until he came near to his brother.",
      "ko": "자기는 그들 앞에서 나아가되 몸을 일곱번 땅에 굽히며 그 형 에서에게 가까이 하니",
      "source_text_hash": "200a496717f77cb568086c74f5a930ca80bf49201b16c86a33e1ef97448c6df7",
      "translation_text_hash": "67a07e21e6eaa7bce763ee03873c8cd6fe9babc7508ef57f39537300289396da",
