      "en": "Please take the gift that I brought to you, because God has dealt graciously with me, and because I have enough.” He urged him, and he took it.",
      "ko": "하나님이 내게 은혜를 베푸셨고 나의 소유도 족하오니 청컨대 내가 형님께 드리는 예물을 받으소서 하고 그에게 강권하매 받으니라",
      "source_text_hash": "c9cdec20bda702450db94b1c84bbf1bb494bd6ff1c2583afa627077c2b9c0d9b",
      "translation_text_hash": "1b7b1e05ddebfd0a035c46fb1c309ab65b62af605a3a34f79b818a164717c90d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
